notes.content:
Added a sound effect to warn the player that he's about to get caught by the Phantom;
 Added 2 new music tracks to the game ('Stress' and 'Sleepwalking');
 Added 1 small, 1 medium and 1 large level, bringing the total count to 114.


Enjoy!

https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/35565185/c07dce8e3ceef984b2f6515b5241c0f97f58da32.png
This update fixes a few issues found at the last moment before release.


 Fixed a bug in campaign generation that could break the game under certain conditions;
 Campaign generation no longer places the same level twice in the row;
 Adjusted 'Phantom Evader' campaign template;
 Added 2 small, 2 medium and 2 large levels, bringing the total count to 108.


Thank you for playing Phantom 3D.
